<title>ESTONIA: LAST DAY OF TRADING FOR HUVITUSFOND VII SERIES.</title>
<headline>LAST DAY OF TRADING FOR HUVITUSFOND VII SERIES.</headline>
<dateline>TALLINN 1997-05-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Huvitusfond said on Tuesday that it will pay 11.15 percent interest on it seventh series obligation fund and the last day of trading is Tuesday May 20.</p>
<p>The interest will be paid to those registered as holders at the end of the day on May 23, Huvitusfond said in a statement.</p>
<p>May 20 is the last day of trading in the seventh series for inclusion in the list of owners for May 23.</p>
<p>--Tallinn newsroom +372 630 8400 reuters@reuters.ee</p>
